00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:15.260
So let's go over
here and pop into--

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:17.360
this is that machine.

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:18.500
And so I actually have--

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:25.605
I will do a cat
nginx-service.yaml.

