data center in Finland.

00:37:55.830 --> 00:37:57.180
So we're starting there.

00:37:57.180 --> 00:37:58.910
It's up and running.

00:37:58.910 --> 00:38:00.860
We're looking to
move our admin sites.

00:38:00.860 --> 00:38:04.580
And then we're looking to
build small effective data

00:38:04.580 --> 00:38:08.500
centers for where the
regulators require [? cell ?]

00:38:08.500 --> 00:38:10.000
